# The Python versions this project supports, oldest first.
#
# The first entry is the oldest and the development default, so a newer
# language feature fails locally rather than in the oldest CI cell. The last is
# the latest. The ends are exact patch releases because those have to be tested
# exactly; the middle entries are minor series, and setup-python installs the
# newest patch release of each.
#
# tools/versions.sh reads this file and derives WEEWX_PYTHON_OLDEST,
# WEEWX_PYTHON_LATEST, and the CI matrix from it. Its --check reports a
# workflow, .devenv-template, or .devenv that names a different version.
